OL,3,GNEWSAHull KR star named in inaugural
OL,4,AHall of Legends
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe wife of Hull KR great Roger
OL,7,FMillward MBE said she was "over the
OL,8,Fmoon" after he was inducted into the
OL,9,Finaugural International Rugby League
OL,10,FHall of Legends.
OL,12,FMillward played more than 400 times for
OL,13,Fthe Robins and coached them for 11
OL,14,Fseasons after his retirement. He died
OL,15,Fin 2016 at the age of 68.
OL,17,FCarol Millward said she was "so proud"
OL,18,Fof her late husband and his most recent
OL,19,Fhonour.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
