OL,3,GNEWSAHull KR star named in inaugural
OL,4,AHall of Legends
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I can't get over it, to be quite
OL,7,Fhonest," she said. "He's obviously not
OL,8,Fbeing forgotten and he's left a mark
OL,9,Fsomewhere."
